Licensing/branding (cavekit-licensing-branding R3): strip Pale Moon / Basilisk / Moonchild branding URLs from the engine defaults; about:credits -> Jihad project page.

Generated as a clean diff against UXP upstream  (Pale Moon); applies
independently (distinct files) to the pristine third_party/uxp submodule.

